{"id":4604,"date":"2025-07-07T09:31:22","date_gmt":"2025-07-07T09:31:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4604"},"modified":"2025-08-11T06:58:58","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T06:58:58","slug":"cach-huy-don-hang-dinh-ky-tren-amazon-nhanh","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-amazon\/cach-huy-don-hang-dinh-ky-tren-amazon-nhanh\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 tr\u00ean Amazon nhanh ch\u00f3ng, an to\u00e0n"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"PBEAdpVPPo0pfrxHwOal3Vaggqf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JlyTd4Q7AoltQgx97x7lgjBugNf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ec7c h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 tr\u00ean Amazon gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n c\u00e1c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng, tr\u00e1nh b\u1ecb tr\u1eeb ti\u1ec1n ho\u1eb7c giao h\u00e0ng khi kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n nhu c\u1ea7u. Ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi v\u00e0i b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n trong m\u1ee5c \u201cSubscribe &amp; Save\u201d, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1eebng giao h\u00e0ng m\u1ecdi l\u00fac, kh\u00f4ng m\u1ea5t ph\u00ed. T\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u ngay c\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">Lemon Digital<\/span><\/strong><\/a>!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N1bKdfTCronRzgxTPFJlrJl9gbb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-EVxgdNOdAo6hQfxEKN2lneuqgxg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Quy tr\u00ecnh h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UZSsdD4S8oR6w1x6rUPl6wr9gdh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Quy tr\u00ecnh h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 l\u00e0 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua ch\u1ea5m d\u1ee9t vi\u1ec7c nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng theo chu k\u1ef3 \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd (tu\u1ea7n, th\u00e1ng&#8230;) v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m n\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KZx9d37lhoB3eUxMIDKl8qi6gde\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Quy tr\u00ecnh n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng cho c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 nh\u01b0 Amazon Subscribe &amp; Save, Shopee \u0110\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3, ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 kh\u00e1c. M\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch l\u00e0 gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua ng\u01b0ng vi\u1ec7c nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng trong t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai khi kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n nhu c\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4605\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4605\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4605\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/59-2.png\" alt=\"Quy tr\u00ecnh h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 (th\u01b0\u1eddng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng cho c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 mua h\u00e0ng t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng theo chu k\u1ef3 nh\u01b0 Amazon Subscribe &amp; Save\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/59-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/59-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/59-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/59-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/59-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4605\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Quy tr\u00ecnh h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 (th\u01b0\u1eddng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng cho c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 mua h\u00e0ng t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng theo chu k\u1ef3 nh\u01b0 Amazon Subscribe &amp; Save<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"PBEAdpVPPo0pfrxHwOal3Vaggqf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DUhkdScq9oPEX8xYFnolXDWYgTf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><strong>C\u00e1ch h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 tr\u00ean Amazon<\/strong><\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Jy7Id4UkAojD9gxvATzl6lfOgve\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua (Amazon Subscribe &amp; Save)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G30sd3jUQo7Kbix9CSRlhmwIgs1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: \u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Truy c\u1eadp <a href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.com\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Amazon.com<\/a> v\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u00e0o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e3 d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D9ADd0tK7ooG40x53BFlQYIwgWb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Truy c\u1eadp m\u1ee5c \u201cYour Subscribe &amp; Save Items\u201d V\u00e0o \u201cYour Account\u201d \u2192 Ch\u1ecdn \u201cSubscribe &amp; Save\u201d ho\u1eb7c truy c\u1eadp tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp qua \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn: <code>https:\/\/www.amazon.com\/subscribeandsave<\/code><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZJ6Ad5dwHovw5cxK8zLlMwSZgev\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m mu\u1ed1n h\u1ee7y T\u00ecm s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n d\u1eebng \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o ph\u1ea7n &#8220;Subscription details&#8221; ho\u1eb7c &#8220;Manage Subscription&#8221;.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jg9zdKUTToZqIgxbkf4lEtGrgMh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: Nh\u1ea5n \u201cCancel subscription\u201d Ch\u1ecdn \u201cCancel subscription\u201d \u0111\u1ec3 ng\u1eebng giao h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3. Amazon c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 h\u1ecfi l\u00fd do h\u1ee7y v\u00e0 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u b\u1ea1n x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn l\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H8uKdAWlJoT1j8xOyw7lPPSGgth\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: Nh\u1eadn x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn t\u1eeb h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng Amazon s\u1ebd g\u1eedi email x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn h\u1ee7y th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng. B\u1ea1n v\u1eabn c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd l\u1ea1i b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 l\u00fac n\u00e0o n\u1ebfu mu\u1ed1n ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-NOKcdjnmdoOLHFxFS6KlfqTFg7b\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ka14dBYYXoyObLxSGoolfvRNgEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: \u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp Seller Central V\u00e0o <a href=\"https:\/\/sellercentral.amazon.com\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Amazon Seller Central<\/a> b\u1eb1ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D7zodm0CioGNJnxZNQhlMoc3gke\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Truy c\u1eadp m\u1ee5c \u201cManage Orders\u201d V\u00e0o ph\u1ea7n \u201cOrders\u201d \u2192 \u201cManage Orders\u201d \u2192 t\u00ecm \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 ho\u1eb7c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111ang s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZX1gdkbgXo6aE2xGRwzlcAiQgGh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Ki\u1ec3m tra th\u00f4ng tin kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 l\u1ecbch giao Ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ecbch s\u1eed \u0111\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng kh\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u01a1n c\u1ea7n h\u1ee7y ho\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ub6Odo8tRonTM0xYrxiltDfZgze\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: D\u1eebng \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd ho\u1eb7c h\u1ee7y th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng n\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n N\u1ebfu h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng cho ph\u00e9p, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ng\u1eebng l\u1ecbch giao h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 ho\u1eb7c li\u00ean h\u1ec7 v\u1edbi kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn y\u00eau c\u1ea7u h\u1ee7y. Trong m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p, Amazon s\u1ebd x\u1eed l\u00fd tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp n\u1ebfu kh\u00e1ch g\u1eedi y\u00eau c\u1ea7u t\u1eeb ph\u00eda h\u1ecd.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EHnSdRTFaobLLWxelh0lnhJKg7f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: X\u00e1c nh\u1eadn tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u0111\u01a1n v\u00e0 l\u01b0u l\u1ea1i \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ee7y, l\u01b0u l\u1ea1i thay \u0111\u1ed5i v\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i c\u00e1c email x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn t\u1eeb h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MR8Pd95h1oYDb1x4ThalukvugFg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4608\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4608\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4608\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-10.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1ch h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 tr\u00ean Amazon\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-10.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-10-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-10-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-10-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-10-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4608\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e1ch h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 tr\u00ean Amazon<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"PBEAdpVPPo0pfrxHwOal3Vaggqf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-VuVydwD1rovdB0xRJxJlB1dWgYb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch H\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n, \u0111\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 thi\u1ec3u ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ez9UdVvofoumGtxjaTgl91JwgWd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 n\u1ed9i dung t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n, \u0111\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n theo c\u00e1ch tr\u00ecnh b\u00e0y r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, d\u1ec5 hi\u1ec3u, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng cho nhi\u1ec1u n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed (nh\u01b0 Amazon, Shopee, Tiki, Lazada) ho\u1eb7c website b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ri\u00eang.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-AJlMd1pdQoBXT0xPATYlF6jPgDc\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. H\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4606\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4606\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4606\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/58.png\" alt=\"H\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/58.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/58-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/58-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/58-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/58-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4606\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">H\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PadldTeySoBWFvxLDw0lXTKbgzb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng n\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u00e0n giao cho \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, ngh\u0129a l\u00e0 \u0111\u01a1n v\u1eabn n\u1eb1m trong h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n ho\u1eb7c s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed v\u00e0 ch\u01b0a b\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0o qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n. C\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng th\u01b0\u1eddng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb l\u00e0 \u201cCh\u1edd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn\u201d ho\u1eb7c \u201c\u0110ang x\u1eed l\u00fd\u201d, t\u00f9y v\u00e0o t\u1eebng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng. Trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n n\u00e0y, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng v\u1eabn cho ph\u00e9p ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n ho\u1eb7c g\u1eedi y\u00eau c\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ph\u00e1t sinh chi ph\u00ed. Sau khi \u0111\u01a1n chuy\u1ec3n sang tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u201c\u0110ang giao\u201d ho\u1eb7c \u201c\u0110\u00e3 b\u00e0n giao cho \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n\u201d, quy\u1ec1n h\u1ee7y s\u1ebd b\u1ecb gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch ph\u1ea3i x\u1eed l\u00fd theo ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Br3oddwdkoptctx2ISxlWqMNgEh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 h\u1ee7y n\u1ebfu h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng cho ph\u00e9p ho\u1eb7c li\u00ean h\u1ec7 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FCdmdsqEdo5GqrxCnT1lZYsdgUP\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 h\u1ee7y n\u1ebfu h\u1ebft h\u00e0ng, l\u1ed7i t\u1ed3n kho ho\u1eb7c l\u00fd do kh\u00e1ch quan.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UIfxdJlg3oxNFQxK4tXluMudgyk\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">H\u1ee7y c\u00e0ng s\u1edbm c\u00e0ng t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u01a1n b\u1ecb chuy\u1ec3n \u0111i v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t sinh chi ph\u00ed.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"PBEAdpVPPo0pfrxHwOal3Vaggqf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-R56CdKX50oaB9HxcaeEl3k23gJf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. \u0110\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VY25dYs8ao03dMx4w86lnhzWg95\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng trong c\u00e1c tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p nh\u01b0: s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u00fang so v\u1edbi \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u1eb7t (sai m\u1eabu m\u00e3, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc), s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1ecb l\u1ed7i k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt ho\u1eb7c h\u01b0 h\u1ecfng do qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n. Ngo\u00e0i ra, n\u1ebfu ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ed5i sang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00e1c v\u00ec thay \u0111\u1ed5i nhu c\u1ea7u, vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng v\u1eabn c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn n\u1ebfu ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n \u0111\u1ed3ng \u00fd v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f2n trong t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng nguy\u00ean v\u1eb9n, ch\u01b0a s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NfQmdQWkWovTVCxQGZyl3tfDgZd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YUm0dtxJboh6JdxTimSlsycKgPg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f2n nguy\u00ean bao b\u00ec, ch\u01b0a qua s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TE3zdmcN5ofnz0xEULil0v0YgPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C\u00f3 \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 h\u00f3a \u0111\u01a1n, m\u00e3 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, b\u1eb1ng ch\u1ee9ng (\u1ea3nh\/video).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6z8dRg61olY0xxyY2fl2Toagxg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u g\u1eedi \u0111\u1ed5i trong v\u00f2ng 3\u20137 ng\u00e0y t\u1eeb khi nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng (tu\u1ef3 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch m\u1ed7i n\u01a1i).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UsVud1WN1ofywqx9wfvlvpjXgnd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Kh\u00f4ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ed5i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng nhanh, \u0111\u1ed3 \u0103n, h\u00e0ng gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, \u0111\u1ed3 d\u00f9ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n&#8230;<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-J34cdCN7ioGgKUx6g91lOvlygMj\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4572\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4572\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4572\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-3.png\" alt=\"\u0110\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-3-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-3-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-3-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4572\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u0110\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"PBEAdpVPPo0pfrxHwOal3Vaggqf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-BHjBdv9gUoqVH8xhdqvlNCRkgPh\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3.<\/strong> <strong> Ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DtRSdlkPXoxFpsxv6GtlWLcdggf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n ho\u1eb7c m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n trong c\u00e1c tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p:\u00a0h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao \u0111i; tr\u1ea3 l\u1ea1i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m sau khi nh\u1eadn do b\u1ecb l\u1ed7i k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt, h\u01b0 h\u1ecfng ho\u1eb7c giao sai m\u1eabu m\u00e3; \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng b\u1ecb th\u1ea5t l\u1ea1c, giao kh\u00f4ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng ho\u1eb7c x\u1ea3y ra l\u1ed7i trong qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh thanh to\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ENc3dgVJoolNbRx5REilteQPgCf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n: Tr\u1ea3 v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng, v\u00ed \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed ho\u1eb7c ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c thanh to\u00e1n ban \u0111\u1ea7u. Th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n: t\u1eeb 1 \u0111\u1ebfn 14 ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c t\u00f9y n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng v\u00e0 ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng. V\u1edbi m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c thanh to\u00e1n (nh\u01b0 phi\u1ebfu qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng), kho\u1ea3n ho\u00e0n l\u1ea1i s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ed9ng v\u00e0o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n n\u1ed9i b\u1ed9 (v\u00ed, gift card) thay v\u00ec ho\u00e0n ra ti\u1ec1n m\u1eb7t. V\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n v\u1edbi s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u1ed7i do ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng g\u00e2y ra.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AhF3dJa0OoBFONxPY8vlK8gcgvh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Sh8odfCRYoDJS0xHghblhmiagVh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u01b0u \u00fd khi h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon<\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4579\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4579\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4579\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/59-1.png\" alt=\"M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u01b0u \u00fd khi h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/59-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/59-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/59-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/59-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/59-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4579\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u01b0u \u00fd khi h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"list-number1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TMpFdUb5goXOQXx8w7xlfGmNgde\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 h\u1ee7y n\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng n\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n v\u1eabn \u0111ang \u1edf tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u201cNot yet shipped\u201d (ch\u01b0a giao h\u00e0ng). Khi \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u00e3 chuy\u1ec3n sang tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u201cShipping soon\u201d ho\u1eb7c \u201cShipped\u201d, b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 h\u1ee7y tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp m\u00e0 ph\u1ea3i ch\u1edd nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng r\u1ed3i l\u00e0m th\u1ee7 t\u1ee5c ho\u00e0n tr\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F3c4dMJ4ZosUGzxEcELlvf12gXg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>\n<p>H\u1ee7y c\u00e0ng s\u1edbm c\u00e0ng t\u1ed1t Amazon x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng r\u1ea5t nhanh, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u1edbi \u0111\u01a1n FBA (Fulfilled by Amazon). N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n h\u1ee7y, n\u00ean th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n ngay sau khi \u0111\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V4ZpdFXmCotzL0xfh1vlVlhngJf\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>\n<p>Kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb t\u00ednh ph\u00ed khi h\u1ee7y \u0111\u00fang th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m Vi\u1ec7c h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng ch\u01b0a giao s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng m\u1ea5t ph\u00ed v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 n\u1ebfu \u0111\u00e3 thanh to\u00e1n tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TmQJdORogod1k8x7bnHlzCdFgvb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>\n<p>X\u00e1c nh\u1eadn h\u1ee7y s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eedi qua email Sau khi h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, Amazon s\u1ebd g\u1eedi email x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn. N\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c email, b\u1ea1n n\u00ean ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ea1i tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng trong t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WgFEdaJ3VoazyjxjAHflPfqQggd\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>\n<p>\u0110\u01a1n h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n b\u00ean th\u1ee9 ba (Third-party sellers) V\u1edbi nh\u1eefng \u0111\u01a1n kh\u00f4ng do Amazon tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp x\u1eed l\u00fd, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 c\u1ea7n g\u1eedi y\u00eau c\u1ea7u h\u1ee7y t\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n. H\u1ecd c\u00f3 quy\u1ec1n t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i n\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KeRNd0ioEo164PxtsKKlKDi7gWb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>\n<p>H\u1ee7y m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng g\u1ed3m nhi\u1ec1u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn h\u1ee7y t\u1eebng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ri\u00eang l\u1ebb thay v\u00ec to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 \u0111\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SGZzdMaNcokffzxkUHxl099Ig1e\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Kh\u00f4ng h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c khi d\u00f9ng phi\u1ebfu qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng Amazon Trong m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n thanh to\u00e1n b\u1eb1ng phi\u1ebfu qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng (Amazon Gift Card), kho\u1ea3n ti\u1ec1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n gift card ch\u1ee9 kh\u00f4ng ho\u00e0n ra ti\u1ec1n m\u1eb7t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JkRKdjuKSoXojmxN0bNl197tgKf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLCWdI4W0o24mdxkehzlqyWFged\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q4BBd61ZtojwVrxuXSflQxcGgUd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RPffdVY1Oog7BPxKAFilCzJ5gZg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z5lVdIeThovUPFx5MLflyyTPgzg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RlwFd7iSZo6TbExTl1HlKob4gGh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Vi\u1ec7c h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 tr\u00ean Amazon gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n c\u00e1c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng, tr\u00e1nh b\u1ecb tr\u1eeb ti\u1ec1n ho\u1eb7c giao h\u00e0ng khi kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n nhu c\u1ea7u. Ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi v\u00e0i b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n trong m\u1ee5c \u201cSubscribe &amp; Save\u201d, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1eebng giao h\u00e0ng m\u1ecdi l\u00fac, kh\u00f4ng m\u1ea5t ph\u00ed. T\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4783,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[31,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4604","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-amazon","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/